-- and Scroll Reference's hand-drawn seal images (201 of the 213 have
-- artwork; the rest print without a symbol until art is added). Two
-- spells (Acid Ward, Affliction) had their casting prefix ("With Will and
-- X") already written down in the sheet; everything else is left null for
-- staff to fill in via the Scroll Tag print panel. Run after
-- scroll-tags-schema.sql.

